hase order for the new hires. It's going to HQ and the total is $1,584.\n\n**Order PO0001**\n- 3 \u00d7 DK-210 USB-C Dock, $199 each ($597)\n- 3 \u00d7 MN-27 27-inch 4K Monitor, $329 each ($987)\n\n**Why DK-210 instead of DK-200:** the only DK-200 docks in stock were refurbished (\"Renewed\", SKU DK-200-R). You asked for new equipment only, so I ordered the approved DK-210 successor instead. All items in the order are new.\n\nThe total is under the $2,500 limit, so it didn't need manager approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}